| Body font | Plus Jakarta Sans (site-wide) |

## Priority checklist (from skill)

1. Accessibility — contrast 4.5:1, aria-labels, keyboard focus
2. Touch — min 44×44px targets, loading feedback
3. Performance — lazy images, no layout shift
4. Style — SVG icons only (no emojis), consistent premium aesthetic
5. Responsive — mobile-first, no horizontal scroll
6. Motion — 150–300ms transitions, respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Skip the skill for

Pure backend logic, API/database, infrastructure, or non-visual scripts.
